'''Bull sharks''' are monsters that can be found in the [[Western Ocean]] and [[Ardent Ocean]]. The player may be assigned to kill them as a [[bounty task]] starting at 30 [[Sailing]]. A guaranteed bounty task can be received from [[Musa Point]].

Any boat with an [[adamant keel]] or better will not take any damage from bull sharks.

==Locations==
The most convenient place to kill bull sharks is just east of [[Hosidius]], as they are found in a [[multicombat area]]. The only other sharks found in multicombat are south-east of the [[Fortis Colosseum]], but they are further from a [[dock]] than the Hosidius sharks are from [[Port Piscarilius]].
